<section class="faq-section" style="padding: 50px 0; background: #0b132b; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 15px;">
    <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 25px; text-align: center;">
      Frequently Asked Questions &bull; Bike Transportation in Tenali | Safe Two-Wheeler Shifting AP-07
    </h2>
    
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does Shree Ashirwad guarantee zero scratches during Bike Transportation In Tenali?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Our hydraulic ramp trailers feature soft‑rubber rollers and precision‑aligned loading docks that eliminate impact. Each bike undergoes a pre‑loading audit, is secured with anti‑vibration straps, and placed inside a sealed, climate‑controlled container. Combined with our 7‑layer packaging, this ensures a scratch‑free journey from Tenali to any destination.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What does the 7‑layer anti‑moisture packaging include for my scooter?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The protocol starts with an 80‑GSM heavy‑duty bubble wrap, followed by high‑density foam edge protectors, a corrugated fiberboard sheet, a stretch‑film moisture barrier, and finally a custom‑cut wooden crate. Each layer works together to repel humidity, absorb shocks, and protect delicate components during transit.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I ship my bike via train parcel service from Tenali, and how does it compare?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes, we coordinate with Indian Railways for bike parcel services. While rail offers cost‑effectiveness for long distances, our dedicated container trucks provide faster door‑to‑door delivery, real‑time GPS tracking, and a zero‑scratch guarantee that train parcels cannot match.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Are bike transport rates from Tenali to Hyderabad fixed or do they vary?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Our rates are transparent and based on distance, bike size, and selected packaging level. For standard two‑wheelers on the Tenali‑Hyderabad corridor, we offer a fixed base price with optional add‑ons such as premium insurance or expedited delivery, ensuring no hidden surprises.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What documentation is needed for corporate or government bill reimbursement for bike moving?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">We provide GST‑compliant invoices, e‑Way bills, and a detailed shipment manifest. For corporate or PSU transfers, we also issue a certified Bill of Lading and insurance certificate. These documents satisfy the reimbursement criteria of central, state, and private entities.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does the pre‑loading audit verify my bike’s condition before transit?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Our trained auditors inspect the bike for existing scratches, dents, and functional issues, documenting each finding with photos and a checklist. This audit is signed by the customer, creating a baseline that protects both parties and ensures any post‑delivery claim is accurately assessed.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Is the insurance claim process straightforward if damage occurs despite the zero‑scratch promise?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes. In the rare event of damage, our 100% IRDAI‑approved marine transit insurance processes claims within 48 hours. You submit the post‑delivery audit report, photos, and the original invoice; we handle the paperwork, and reimbursement is paid directly to you or your insurer.</p>
      </div>
  </div>
